                  (\texttt{DECIDER\_STACK\_DECISION.md} \S11.2). Observed results table: 1b-modernbert-large
                  F1 89.2, 87 examples/s; 3-Llama-3.2-3B-Instruct-LoRA F1 93.1, 152 examples/s (vLLM);
